<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have deployed F-16 fighter jets to the Tak border and are reviewing border policy after construction vehicles were torched in Yala and attacks continued in three southern provinces. The Thai foreign minister travelled to Myanmar for talks with Min Aung Hlaing on border security, while Thailand raised concerns with Myanmar over arsenic-tainted rivers affecting cross-border water. A Thai MP pressed security agencies after an Apple spyware warning to Natthaphong Ruengpanyawut. Cambodia’s military recruitment drive exceeded its target by 50%, and Thailand warned Cambodia against raising the border dispute at the Francophonie summit. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPYko2TXRuRkZsdy04WmdzaW95MzJCTjdfVjFiS1llRGEzOHJCbWpXS1ZTcFJNeS1RVlNRN1RDd2F6OVdYeTVBaHNITWFJX3ZPRkdwVDhiV0tsOFk1eEk3ZkZUSFVnTTN5Tm9pa05qQWZuaUFuYWhGbW5PekxvRGxkUTJfT0VzTmU2Q2VZLVJtd2E3cXVrdml2WjdISkJtNWV5eXZDS2pQc1c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Dazzling Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOS2dxa3BjSXFxcktBbjFhbkZYNEVhMVdYMjFUeDZwSUNfZUluRDJpODlBem9OQU9QZVhIXzN1V3g3RVJoREVVSkg4b0RKSTg3ZTZ2TS1PWFlKQU9kNUgtN3hWa2d5NUE0R0xOVnJDV3VhM2ltRklMMkx5d3lpU1Bza0JnVXdxczVDNFdfRmFWcjR1RElpUTF5dm5DTm1FblYyMTdNdGRUTGJ6TVJUT3h1TTB3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNT2t6UFZhUUZNQm9FMF9ZWVBhRVdHVDFNWVlQSjdoUHp6dGp5WWlWOHRTS2M2aU1MaFZWQVdwaUhaU2lMWUtLbFk4bWwwaXl2dDd0TnJ6UUctWGIwaDJab1l5d29WUnNKWjEyeEZhSVI1UFRoUFYxNVZ3RkdSQzlyV3E1bG1lVEtKbXFxVDBhcjl1VTQwcGFxdDBrTy1UbU5qOUhvQ05oeWQzaV9vUlRuUEhDYVZucW4zbkoyd3hXeUlsdDJJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/economy/global-economy/article/3374280/chinese-e-commerce-seller